sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor I as Invigilator
    participant UI as SRS Console
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant PC as PC door program
    actor S as Student
    I->>UI: enter details, venue, device, tick consent, Start enrollment
    activate UI
    UI->>+API: POST /api/students
    API->>DB: INSERT students (enrollment_status = pending)
    API-->>-UI: 201 {id}
    par console waits
        loop every 3 s until enrolled or failed (max 10 min)
            UI->>API: GET /api/students/{id}
            API-->>UI: enrollment_status
        end
    and door program polls
        loop every 3 s
            PC->>+API: GET /api/devices/{id}/pending-enrollments
            API->>DB: pending students of this device (last 10 min)
            API-->>-PC: [studentId, studentNumber, name]
        end
    end
    activate PC
    PC->>PC: window shows "ENROLLING name"
    S->>PC: stands at the marker, faces camera
    loop 5 samples, 0.25 s apart
        PC->>PC: one face >= 90 px? detect + embed
    end
    alt 5 good samples within 60 s
        PC->>PC: average embeddings, save embedding file and photo
        PC->>API: PUT /api/students/{id}/enrollment-image (JPEG)
        PC->>+API: PUT /api/students/{id}/enrollment (status: enrolled)
        API->>DB: UPDATE students SET enrollment_status = enrolled
        API-->>-PC: 200
        UI-->>I: "Enrolled"
    else time-out
        PC->>API: PUT /api/students/{id}/enrollment (status: failed)
        API->>DB: UPDATE students SET enrollment_status = failed
        UI-->>I: "Failed" - Try again / Re-enroll
    end
    deactivate PC
    deactivate UI
